```json
{{ rotated_board | tojson }}
```

The Business Franchise pillar MUST reflect this rotated framing. A moat against a "competitor" that is actually a market creator is not a moat; it is a dependency. An asymmetry of need must be reflected in the durability assessment.
{% endif %}

